## Post-failover reconciliation

After the HA layer moves a guest, the repository and the cluster disagree about
where things live. Reconcile deliberately: confirm the guest is healthy on its
new host (`task proxmox:ha-status`), check whether replication jobs still point
at the right source, and either accept the new placement in `hosts.yml` or
migrate it back. Leaving it undecided means the next deploy fights the HA
manager.

